.Dd October 23, 2026
.Dt WISP 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm wisp
.Nd local-first differential OKF knowledge store
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm wisp
.Op Fl -repo Ar dir
.Op Fl -actor Ar id
.Op Fl -json
.Op Fl -quiet
.Ar command
.Op Ar args ...
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
stores an Open Knowledge Format (OKF) bundle as an append-only, section-level
changeset log with encrypted payloads.
It materializes conformant markdown on checkout and supports agent commits with
optimistic concurrency.
.Pp
This manual page is an overview.
Behavioral contracts, exit codes, JSON envelopes, and per-command semantics live
in installed topic documentation (see below), not in
.Cm --help
alone.
.Sh GLOBAL OPTIONS
.Bl -tag -width 12n
.It Fl -repo Ar dir
Repository root (default: nearest ancestor containing
.Pa .wisp/ ) .
.It Fl -actor Ar string
Actor:
.Ar producer/version ,
.Cm human:id ,
or
.Cm process:id
(default:
.Ev WISP_ACTOR ,
then config).
.It Fl -json
Write exactly one JSON object to stdout
.Pq Cm ok ,
.Cm command ,
.Cm data
or
.Cm error .
Human text goes to stderr.
.It Fl -quiet
Suppress human-readable stdout.
.It Fl -passphrase Ar string
Unlock keystore (alternative to key file or
.Ev WISP_MASTER_KEY ) .
.It Fl -no-index
Skip in-process subscribers for this invocation.
.El
.Sh WRITE PATHS
.Bl -tag -width 14n
.It Cm record
Working-tree edits become one changeset; OKF files are re-rendered.
.It Cm update Ns , Nm add-section Ns , Nm set Ns , Nm create Ns , Nm apply
Headless writes (no working-tree round-trip).
Each single-op command is shorthand for one entry in an
.Cm apply
batch; see topic
.Cm apply .
.El
.Sh DOCUMENTATION
Installed topic files (Markdown) are the contract for agents and integrators:
.Bl -tag -width 16n
.It Cm wisp doc list
List topics and file paths.
.It Cm wisp doc path
Print the documentation directory
.Pq typically
.Pa ~/.local/share/wisp/doc ) .
.It Cm wisp doc cli
CLI contract: exit codes, target grammar, JSON, limits of success.
.It Cm wisp doc Ar topic
Print a topic
.Pq e.g. Nm erase Ns , Nm merge Ns , Nm search Ns , Nm impact Ns , Nm trust ) .
.El
.Pp
Set
.Ev WISP_DOC_ROOT
if documentation was installed elsewhere.
.Sh EXIT STATUS
.Bl -tag -width 10n
.It 0
Success.
.It 2
Usage error.
.It 3
Conflict (stale
.Fl -base ,
merge conflict; see JSON
.Cm error.code ) .
.It 4
Policy refusal.
.It 5
Validation failure.
.It 7
Retryable SQLite lock (back off and retry).
.It 8
Integrity / fsck failure.
.It 9
Key unavailable.
.It 10
Erasure recovery pending; reopen or complete recovery.
.El
Details:
.Cm wisp doc cli
and
.Pa CONCURRENCY.md .
.Sh ENVIRONMENT
.Bl -tag -width 16n
.It Ev WISP_ACTOR
Default actor when
.Fl -actor
is omitted.
.It Ev WISP_DOC_ROOT
Override documentation directory for
.Cm wisp doc .
.It Ev WISP_MASTER_KEY
Master key material (see trust docs).
.It Ev XDG_DATA_HOME
Base for
.Pa wisp/doc
when
.Ev WISP_DOC_ROOT
is unset.
.El
.Sh FILES
.Bl -tag -width 20n
.It Pa ~/.local/share/wisp/doc/
Default topic documentation (user install).
.It Pa ~/.local/share/man/man1/wisp.1
Default manual page (user install).
.It Pa .wisp/
Bundle metadata, ledger, keys, cache (per repository).
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Cm wisp doc cli ,
.Cm wisp doc erase ,
.Cm wisp doc merge ,
.Cm wisp doc search ,
.Cm wisp doc impact ,
.Cm wisp doc apply ,
.Cm wisp doc trust
.Pp
